# The pretokenized-corpus cache is large and rebuildable.
corpora/
# tokenizers/ is deliberately NOT ignored, and manifest.json now lives in
# ../paper/generated/. At ~1.1 MB each the matched grid is about 33 MB, which is worth
# paying so a cell is never trained twice: builds are long and this container loses its
# working tree regularly, so an untracked tokenizer is one that has to be retrained.
# See train_multilang.py.
